+|---|---|---|
+| Semantic round-trip, Roblox v9 | **24 / 72** | **28 / 72** |
+| `luau-core` unit tests | 954 pass | **957 pass** (3 new locks) |
+| Silent-corruption classes known | 4 | **0 in the tested paths** |
+
+Per file (passes / 6):
+
+| file | before | after |
